{% doc %}
  Size Guide — Clean Minimalist Table (Zero-Jerk & Horizontal Scroll)

  - Native <dialog> with zero-jerk scroll stability (tabindex="-1" autofocus prevents off-screen focus jump).
  - Horizontal swipeable table (.sg__table-wrap) for seamless left-right scrolling across all screen sizes.
  - Pure measurement matrix without action buttons or sold-out clutter.
  - Active size row automatically highlighted based on current PDP variant.
  - cm / in flips each number in place.
{% enddoc %}

